Requirement Analysis:
We must preserve protocol-required files exactly and build with CMake. Core domain mechanics (bird physics, pipe movement, collision, scoring, game-over, reset) must be implemented in reusable modules. Deterministic tests will drive updates via fixed dt and a seeded RNG boundary. The runtime entry provides a short, non-interactive demo. The architecture separates domain logic from RNG/time/UI and avoids circular dependencies.

